cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its derived results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NEPSE Floorsheet Microstructure: Broker Networks, Concentration, and Market Integrity in a Frontier Exchange"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research pipeline for a predictive study of broker-network
  structure in the most-traded tier of the Nepal Stock Exchange (NEPSE),
  2021-2024. The v2.0 release adds Romano-Wolf multiplicity control, a
  liquidity/SE/wild-bootstrap robustness battery, EGARCH-standardised
  outcomes, quantile tails, an H7 specification curve, subgroup and
  event-study upgrades, and a canonical final headline set. Version 2.1.0
  corrects the reciprocity metric and rebuilds every dependent result; H6 is
  the robust headline and H10 the moderate headline. The thesis is
  predictive, not causal.
authors:
